$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=rectintlip  LOC_AFTER=?

* Cauchy-Lipschitz estimate: a function holomorphic on a rectangle varies between two strictly interior points by at most a constant times their distance, the constant coming from the two-point Cauchy formula ( ~ rectintsch without the zero).

